        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana CF66, Solid Brass Large Window Lock Casement Fastener</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis large window lock made by Deltana is easy to install. To fit most applications, it includes 3 different strike types: surface mounted, mortised, and edge mounted. Replace your old worn and painted window locks with these solid brass ones for an all new look. Packaged with matching finish mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-CF66-Specifications.gif?v=1704354782\" width=\"600\" height=\"176\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BC218 Ball Catch Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-small-window-lock-casement-fastener-deltana-cf066\"><b>Smaller Window Lock</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana CF66 Large Window Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lock Pivot Plate Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Pivot Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Handle Projection: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes 3 different matching finish strikes.</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Large Window Lock Casement Fastener, Deltana CF66",
                "description": "Solid Brass Large Window Lock Casement Fastener Deltana CF66 - This large window lock made by Deltana is easy to install. To fit most applications, it includes 3 different strike types: surface mounted, mortised, and edge mounted. Replace your old worn and painted window locks with these solid brass ones for an all new look. Packaged with matching finish mounting hardware.",
